nding gap, the following actions are recommended:\n\n1. **Short-term Financing / Credit Facility Arrangements:**\n   - Establish or increase short-term credit facilities to cover the funding gaps, particularly in the months of February, March, and April 2026.\n   - Negotiate favorable terms with financial institutions to ensure that the company can access the necessary funds quickly and at a reasonable cost.\n\n2. **Accelerated Accounts Receivable Collection:**\n   - Implement more aggressive collection strategies for accounts receivable, especially in the months leading up to and during the risk periods.\n   - Consider offering early payment discounts to customers to encourage faster payments.\n   - Evaluate the possibility of factoring receivables to improve cash inflows.\n\nThese actions will help mitigate the risks associated with the projected cash flow shortfall and ensure that the company maintains a healthy cash position throughout the forecast period.\n\n---\n\nPlease review the forecast and the recommended actions. If you have any questions or need further information, feel free to reach out.\n\nBest regards,  \nWorkHarness AI"}]}, "index": 169}
